meta {
  name: Share TRF All
  type: http
  seq: 41
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/share-trf-all
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  content-type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "recipientType": "PATIENT",
    "email": "patient@example.com",
    "whatsapp": "919999999999"
  }
}

docs {
  Share the order's TRF over Email + WhatsApp to the chosen recipient AND raise the
  in-app (IAM) notification, in one call — the Accession "Send All". IAM targets the
  order creator + referral parties (internal-referral employee), not the patient.

  Returns `{ orderId, results: [{ channel, status, reason?, logId? }] }`; a channel
  with no activated template is skipped, not an error. The TRF PDF is rendered once
  and reused across Email/WhatsApp. Prereqs: activated `order_bill_as_attachment`
  templates (Email/WhatsApp/IAM) + an active `trf_print` PDF template.
}
